---
description: 
globs: *.cpp,*.hpp,*.h
alwaysApply: false
---
When you are asked to do something with thre resources files you must follow following rules:
1. Put everything in one file *Resource.cpp/.hpp
2. Don't create any helper files until you wasn't asked explictely
3. Don't forget to register  in RTTR all resource classes that are used for serialization
4. When you are loading another resource during loading of the other resource use immediate resource loading mode ResourceService::Load(const io::fs::path& path, bool immediate = false)